'''Dagannoth spawn''' are baby [[dagannoth]] hatched from [[Egg (Dagannoth)|eggs]] found near the walls or water of [[Waterbirth Dungeon]]. The eggs will hatch as players walk near, as long as the nearby dagannoth are not yet [[Tolerance|tolerant]] towards the player. The eggs respawn after 5 minutes.

Despite their low [[combat level]], they are hostile to players of all levels.

